sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Warp SQL server
  C->>S: POST /warp/v1/sessions/{id}/statements<br/>Accept: application/vnd.apache.arrow.stream<br/>{"sql", "parameters"}
  alt a query
    S-->>C: 200 Arrow IPC stream (schema, batches, end-of-stream)<br/>Warp-Statement-Id
  else no rows (DDL, DML)
    S-->>C: 200 application/json statement document
  else fails before the answer starts
    S-->>C: 4xx problem document, with Warp-Statement-Id when it ran
  end
